<title>UK: BOE gives UK money market 600 mln stg further help.</title>
<headline>BOE gives UK money market 600 mln stg further help.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said it provided the UK money market with a further 600 million stg of assistance at established interest rates.</p>
<p>			    EARLY	1200 GMT   1400 GMT   LATE</p>
<p> FORECAST SHORTAGE    1.0 BLN    1.0 BLN    =	    =</p>
<p> CUMULATIVE SUPPLY     50 MLN    650 MLN    =	    =</p>
<p> DETAILS</p>
<p> BILLS/FRG TO MARCH 3  50 MLN#   600 MLN#    =	    =</p>
<p> # INTEREST RATE - 5-31/32 PCT (INDICATES UNCHANGED BASE  RATES)</p>
</text>
